31
00:02:59,258 --> 00:03:09,174
er iz gevezn a a z- a mark-shteyer mit manufaktur reshtn.

32
00:03:10,902 --> 00:03:12,904
far vos iz er geshtorbn?

33
00:03:13,112 --> 00:03:19,737
er hot gekoyft dos shtof in in di shtot Lodzh,

34
00:03:19,879 --> 00:03:26,268
un gebrengt nokh Zuskevole un ge- geforn oyf di merk arum,

35
00:03:26,562 --> 00:03:31,382
nokh Shudik, nokh Vilove, nokh di ⟨vort⟩.

36
00:03:31,708 --> 00:03:37,322
tsulib vos iz er geshtorbn? ir veyst?

37
00:03:38,965 --> 00:03:43,053
ikh veys ikh veys aleyn nor iz es

38
00:03:43,053 --> 00:03:47,193
fun a khole- fun di kholeres un nokh fun di alte sortn.

39
00:03:47,942 --> 00:03:50,349
ikh veys, er iz geshtorbn shoyn.

40
00:03:51,672 --> 00:03:55,260
un dertseylt mir a bisl fun ayer mamen.

41
00:03:56,110 --> 00:04:00,727
di mame iz gevezn zeyer a kluge froy.

42
00:04:00,936 --> 00:04:02,837
vos iz geven ir nomen?

43
00:04:02,775 --> 00:04:04,693
di nomen iz gevezn Gitl.

44
00:04:05,205 --> 00:04:09,519
un vos iz getrogn dernokh ven ayer foter iz geshtorbn?

45
00:04:09,897 --> 00:04:15,606
nakher hot zi geforn oyf mer- di zi iz gevezn in di milkhome,

46
00:04:15,606 --> 00:04:20,370
zi hot veynik zikh farforn, veynik zikh bavegt,

47
00:04:21,084 --> 00:04:26,900
un zi hot getun vos zi hot gekent.

48
00:04:27,953 --> 00:04:31,811
fun der heym? zi hot gearbet fun der heym?

49
00:04:31,564 --> 00:04:38,730
zi iz gevezn fun der heym for for di khasene hot zi gev- gevezn a

50
00:04:38,787 --> 00:04:46,155
trayb- traybl-LADY. zi hot geshpolt a shpolt LADY.

51
00:04:46,633 --> 00:04:51,656
ven ir zaynt geven tsvey yor alt, mit vos hot zi gehandlt?

52
00:04:52,776 --> 00:04:54,272
veys ikh nisht.

53
00:04:54,345 --> 00:04:57,916
oykh mit dem mit dem, UNK m'hot nisht ir opgelot.

54
00:04:58,125 --> 00:05:01,781
vayl zey hobn gehat, zi hot gehat a groyse kredit

55
00:05:01,787 --> 00:05:07,535
bay di sokhrim vos hot gekoyft un zey hobn zi untershtitst vi vayt meglekh.

56
00:05:07,592 --> 00:05:11,605
un zey hobn gekent mayn foter, vi zayt meglekh

57
00:05:11,605 --> 00:05:15,129
hobn zey dem untershtitst az zi zol krign skhoyre.

58
00:05:15,709 --> 00:05:18,538
ir hot gehat brider un shvester?

59
00:05:18,797 --> 00:05:20,478
ikh hob gehat a shvester.

60
00:05:20,350 --> 00:05:22,251
ir nomen iz geven?

61
00:05:21,430 --> 00:05:23,533
der nomen iz gevezn Khane.

62
00:05:23,539 --> 00:05:25,473
zi iz geven elter fun aykh?

63
00:05:25,294 --> 00:05:27,954
NO, eyn yor fun yinger vi mir.

64
00:05:29,310 --> 00:05:32,409
vos far a shtub hostu gevoynt?

65
00:05:32,702 --> 00:05:37,707
zi hot gevoynt in Zuskevole. fuftsik toyznt aynvoyner.

66
00:05:38,406 --> 00:05:49,082
bay tsen toyznt, nayn toyznt, bay tsen toyznt yidn hobn gevoynt, merstn khasidim un arbeter.

67
00:05:50,640 --> 00:05:53,654
di yidn zaynen geven skhoyrim?

68
00:05:54,133 --> 00:05:56,894
NO, m'hot gehat kroyvim oykh.

69
00:05:57,694 --> 00:06:04,303
un vos far a shtub hostu gevoynt? in vos far a shtub?

70
00:06:03,398 --> 00:06:04,742
eyn shtub.

71
00:06:05,541 --> 00:06:08,200
ir kent es bashraybn a bisl?

72
00:06:07,195 --> 00:06:10,921
a geveyntlekhe shtub iz es geshtanen a

73
00:06:10,921 --> 00:06:15,120
eyn bet oder tsvey betn, gedenk ikh nisht, tsvey betn varshaynlekh.

74
00:06:15,514 --> 00:06:19,777
un s'geven oreme shtub.

75
00:06:22,095 --> 00:06:28,214
biz akht yor hob ikh nisht ge- farzukht keyn ROLL. ikh hob nisht vos iz a ROLL.

76
00:06:28,947 --> 00:06:32,079
vos iz geven ven ir zaynt geven akht yor?

77
00:06:32,119 --> 00:06:39,439
akht yor hob ikh ge- tsugeholfn shoyn a a a CAKE bekeray aropnemen

78
00:06:39,439 --> 00:06:42,592
kikhlekh fun di fanen azoy vi er hot zey gebakn,

79
00:06:42,700 --> 00:06:45,866
un ikh hob gekrign a por ROLLS far dem.

80
00:06:47,188 --> 00:06:51,299
vo ayer heym iz geven a religyezer heym?

81
00:06:51,070 --> 00:06:55,772
ye, mayn MOTHER iz gevezn zeyer religyez.

82
00:06:56,014 --> 00:06:59,990
nor ikh hob shoyn ongehoybn denken a bisl frayer.

83
00:07:01,110 --> 00:07:02,943
vi alt zaynt ir geven

84
00:07:01,600 --> 00:07:02,826
draytsn.

85
00:07:03,068 --> 00:07:04,057
damolts?

86
00:07:04,030 --> 00:07:05,357
elev yor.

87
00:07:08,653 --> 00:07:13,743
ir gedenkt vi di mame flegt praven di yom-toyvim un shabosim?

88
00:07:13,159 --> 00:07:16,713
yo, zi hot ge- zi hot nisht farfelt eyn mol oykh nisht.

89
00:07:16,483 --> 00:07:19,464
ir kent es bashraybn far undz?

90
00:07:18,542 --> 00:07:21,067
mayn ma- ye MOTHER, zikher.

91
00:07:21,192 --> 00:07:25,086
mayn MOTHER hot hot gekont regenen un shneyen,

92
00:07:25,086 --> 00:07:31,262
un a frost un a un velkhn veg es zol nisht zayn, iz zi geganen in di shul.

93
00:07:31,262 --> 00:07:35,259
"dos iz mayn teater," hot zi gezogt. "dos iz mayn fargenign.

94
00:07:35,367 --> 00:07:38,905
es ken mir keyner nisht keyn deyes zogn vos ikh hob tsu tsun."

95
00:07:40,058 --> 00:07:42,701
ir gedenkt shabes in hoyz?

96
00:07:43,197 --> 00:07:46,813
shabes iz geven alts opgekokht fun nekhtn,

97
00:07:46,813 --> 00:07:55,020
un m'hot es alts UNK geleygt in a kishn arayn s'zol s'zol zikh nisht opkiln tsu fil.

98
00:07:55,161 --> 00:07:57,821
yedn fals, m'iz adurkhgekumen.

99
00:07:58,452 --> 00:08:01,416
ir hot gehat kroyvim arum zikh?

100
00:08:01,692 --> 00:08:05,516
yo. kroyvim un ale zenen geven zeyer frum.

101
00:08:05,607 --> 00:08:09,600
un velkhe kroyvim hot ir gehat in shtot mit aykh?

102
00:08:09,302 --> 00:08:17,143
er hot gehat, di mame hot gehat di di mame hot gehat tsvey brider.

103
00:08:17,149 --> 00:08:18,527
zeyer nemen?

104
00:08:19,174 --> 00:08:26,728
eyner hot geheysn Mortkhe Grenek, der tsveyter hot geheysn Kalmen Grenek.

105
00:08:27,493 --> 00:08:29,866
ir hot zikh gehodevet tsuzamen?

106
00:08:30,143 --> 00:08:34,864
NO, gehodevet, NO. ikh hob nisht gehat mit zey keyn gesheftn.

107
00:08:34,864 --> 00:08:39,316
ikh bin a mol gegangen, un az di mame iz geganen ze'mir ale geganen.

108
00:08:39,693 --> 00:08:48,226
BUT azoy hot men nisht hot zikh nisht gut ge- ikh hob nisht arayngepast in di mishpokhe. als kind.

109
00:08:49,363 --> 00:08:53,238
vos far a shprakhn hostu geredt in hoyz?

110
00:08:55,455 --> 00:09:01,136
vos far a shprakhn? az ikh zol zogn azoy az merstn hot men geredt yidish.

111
00:09:01,648 --> 00:09:05,000
nor poylish hot men gelernt di kinder.

112
00:09:05,192 --> 00:09:11,463
un un d- daytsh iz gevezn a tsayt ven der daytsh iz nokh gevezn.

113
00:09:11,841 --> 00:09:16,509
in der milkhome hot men geredt hot men gekent daytsh.

114
00:09:16,549 --> 00:09:19,310
in velkhn milkhome iz dos geven?

115
00:09:18,405 --> 00:09:20,424
di tsveyt- di ershte milkhome.

116
00:09:22,303 --> 00:09:25,047
du flegst geyn in shul mit di mame?

117
00:09:25,543 --> 00:09:30,903
nisht mit der mamen. ikh fleg in shtibl, in Aleksanderer shtibl.

118
00:09:32,445 --> 00:09:34,717
bist gegangen in a shule?

119
00:09:34,656 --> 00:09:38,078
ye, oder nisht keyn sh- ye a shule.

120
00:09:38,078 --> 00:09:43,830
s'gevezn azoy az a lerer a lerer, a spetsyeler lerer,

121
00:09:43,836 --> 00:09:46,718
hot gelernt rekhenen un er hot gelernt

122
00:09:47,359 --> 00:09:54,478
nisht poylish, vayl oyf poylish hot men gekent azoy a bisl, un er hot gelernt yidish.

123
00:09:56,138 --> 00:09:58,984
ir hot gehat in fraynt in shule?

124
00:09:59,142 --> 00:10:01,768
ikh hob gehat shtendik fraynt.

125
00:10:02,466 --> 00:10:04,046
a sakh fraynt?

126
00:10:03,208 --> 00:10:04,535
a sakh fraynt.

127
00:10:04,828 --> 00:10:07,167
ir flegt zikh mit zey shpiln?

128
00:10:07,933 --> 00:10:13,110
m'hot zikh, yo, mit a vog- mit vegener un mit farshidene zakhn,

129
00:10:13,110 --> 00:10:16,263
arum broyen ober oyfgetun zakhn.

130
00:10:16,371 --> 00:10:20,263
BUT merstn teyl ikh hob gehat fraynt.

131
00:10:20,539 --> 00:10:25,747
vi lang vi- v- oyf vifl yorn zaynt ir gegangen in shule?

132
00:10:26,479 --> 00:10:29,935
biz tsvelef un a halb yor. umgefer.

133
00:10:29,935 --> 00:10:32,987
bay draytsn yor bin ikh avekgeforn shoyn arbetn.

134
00:10:33,904 --> 00:10:36,260
ir hot geglaykht geyn in shule?

135
00:10:36,385 --> 00:10:38,657
yo. yo.

136
00:10:38,477 --> 00:10:40,479
ir hot zikh gut gelernt?

137
00:10:39,726 --> 00:10:40,985
gut gelernt.

138
00:10:41,194 --> 00:10:43,938
dos iz geven a shule bloyz far yidn?

139
00:10:43,928 --> 00:10:44,698
yo.

140
00:10:45,615 --> 00:10:49,358
vos hot ir gevolt zayn ven ir volt gevorn elter?

141
00:10:49,358 --> 00:10:50,520
vos hot ir getrakht?

142
00:10:49,429 --> 00:10:52,696
ikh hob gevolt zayn bal-melokhe, an arbeter.

143
00:10:52,838 --> 00:10:54,621
zint ir zaynt geven,

144
00:10:53,597 --> 00:10:58,851
yo, ikh hob nisht, mayn mame hot mikh gevolt a por mol mitnemen

145
00:10:58,851 --> 00:11:02,496
oyf di merk, bin ikh a mol geforn, tsvey mol geforn.

146
00:11:02,496 --> 00:11:05,556
nakher hob ikh gezogt, s'vet nisht andersh vern.

147
00:11:06,237 --> 00:11:13,824
dos iz mayn bashlus. ikh vel mikh nisht betn bay keynem. ikh gey arbetn.

148
00:11:13,932 --> 00:11:16,156
un vos ikh vel mikh oyslernen

149
00:11:16,156 --> 00:11:19,629
vel vel ikh vel ikh zayn a guter bal-melokhe.

150
00:11:19,956 --> 00:11:23,899
m'mikh betn. azoy iz take gevezn.

151
00:11:24,293 --> 00:11:28,843
kent ir mir dertseyln vi azoy ir zaynt arayn in bekershaft?

152
00:11:29,406 --> 00:11:35,087
mayner ikh hob gehat an onkl. di mame's a shvester.

153
00:11:36,274 --> 00:11:39,592
un er iz gevezn a a tsuker-beker.

154
00:11:39,463 --> 00:11:41,448
vos iz geven zayn nomen?

155
00:11:41,202 --> 00:11:42,377
Zalmen.

156
00:11:42,822 --> 00:11:44,385
Zalmen. Granik?

157
00:11:45,015 --> 00:11:48,384
vi? NO. Zalmen Prints.

158
00:11:49,251 --> 00:11:51,169
un vos iz geshen dernokh?

159
00:11:51,883 --> 00:11:56,149
dernokh hob ikh gearbet a halb yor, tsi dray fertl yor,

160
00:11:56,149 --> 00:12:00,399
nakher bin ikh gegangen tsu an an- tsu a tsveytn. un tsu a dritn.

161
00:12:00,386 --> 00:12:01,727
vos UNK,

162
00:12:00,760 --> 00:12:06,929
fir fir bekers iz geven. fir tsuker-bekers. nor ale nisht keyn bal-melokhes.

163
00:12:07,307 --> 00:12:11,013
dernokh bin ikh geforn tsu dernebike shtetlekh.

164
00:12:11,172 --> 00:12:21,543
eyns hot geheysn Lusk, Lask, L.A.S., S., K. Lask.

165
00:12:22,461 --> 00:12:28,817
un un dos tsveyte iz gevezn a groyse shtot, greser a bisl fun Vol- Zinskevole.

166
00:12:29,143 --> 00:12:34,582
hot geheysn Pabyeyitse. dos iz a shtot nebn Lodzh.

167
00:12:34,582 --> 00:12:38,031
shoyn geven tramvay durkh Lodzh.

168
00:12:38,155 --> 00:12:45,416
un shabes nokh mitog bin ikh bin ikh mir arayngeforn in Lodzh arayn, in UNK arayn,

169
00:12:45,416 --> 00:12:52,233
un ikh hob zikh arumge- ikh hob gehat khaveyrim un bakante, m'hot dort gegesn, m'hot epes getrunken,

170
00:12:52,233 --> 00:12:54,534
m'hot g- gut farbrengt.

171
00:12:56,869 --> 00:13:04,977
dos heyst ir zaynt avek fun ayer shtetl, un zikh ibergebn in andern shtot?

172
00:13:04,024 --> 00:13:05,402
in an andere shtetl.

173
00:13:05,627 --> 00:13:09,721
vi lang hot ir gevoynt in dem andern shtot?

174
00:13:10,200 --> 00:13:16,286
ikh bin geforn ikh bin ikh hob dernokh hob ikh gearbet in Lodzh, oyf tsvey shteln.

175
00:13:16,410 --> 00:13:22,412
Khaim bay Khaim Vershinski un der tsveyter gedenk nisht dem nomen.

176
00:13:22,553 --> 00:13:26,917
un un nakher bin ikh geforn, ikh hob gearbet in Tshenstakhov,

177
00:13:27,143 --> 00:13:32,115
un ikh hob gearbet in in Kolish oykhet.

178
00:13:33,117 --> 00:13:40,462
ikh hob ikh hob genumen di di zakh az fun yede shtot nem ikh epes tsu dem fakh.

179
00:13:40,462 --> 00:13:46,594
ikh lern mikh epes oys. un bay dem hob ikh gemuzt un m'hot es,

180
00:13:46,650 --> 00:13:52,570
shpeter vel ikh dertseyln vegn a po- a po- a politsyant un vegn a

181
00:13:52,570 --> 00:13:57,377
a PRZEWODNIK vos hot mikh getsvungen ikh zol baleygn an ekzamen.

182
00:14:00,690 --> 00:14:05,426
lomir geyn a bisl tsurik tsu Zdo- tsu Do- tsu Zdonskavola.

183
00:14:05,989 --> 00:14:12,244
du shtot hot gehat a groyse shul?

184
00:14:13,178 --> 00:14:14,032
yo.

185
00:14:15,321 --> 00:14:19,770
un ir hot balangt tsu organizatsyes in dem shtetl?

186
00:14:19,945 --> 00:14:20,901
yo.

187
00:14:20,974 --> 00:14:21,710
velkh-

188
00:14:21,126 --> 00:14:25,608
ale orga- ale organizatsyes. fun A. biz Z.

189
00:14:26,104 --> 00:14:28,275
ir kent mir zogn velkhe?

190
00:14:30,458 --> 00:14:34,687
s'vet zayn shverlekh a bisl ober ikh ken ikh ken gedenken.

191
00:14:34,862 --> 00:14:46,517
di Bund iz gevezn. di tsienistn zenen geven. di Poyle Tsien, Rekhts un Links. komunistn zenen geven.

192
00:14:47,434 --> 00:14:55,679
s'zenen geven di khsidishe ORGANISATIONS. fun eyns gemisht mit tsien.

193
00:14:56,496 --> 00:15:05,990
un un a groyse turn-fareyn, a zeyer a groyse, dos hobn di fraye mentshn, di fraye gvirim fun di shtot

194
00:15:06,013 --> 00:15:09,483
oysgeboyt aza turn-fareyn, eyn sheyne zakh.

195
00:15:10,013 --> 00:15:12,707
un m'hot gehat a daytsh turn-lerer.

196
00:15:14,113 --> 00:15:22,258
un ikh bin geven a barn dos iz di di sportler.

197
00:15:22,585 --> 00:15:25,110
un ikh bin geven zeyer gut.

198
00:15:25,774 --> 00:15:29,075
tsu velkhn organizatsye hot ir balangt?

199
00:15:28,930 --> 00:15:30,983
di barn, barn.

200
00:15:31,680 --> 00:15:35,600
tsi sports, tsi parteyvayz?

201
00:15:35,600 --> 00:15:38,289
parteyvayz tsu tsu di Linke Poyle Tsien.

202
00:15:42,025 --> 00:15:47,301
di yidn zaynen gut ongegangen mit di goyim in dem shtot?

203
00:15:47,593 --> 00:15:50,759
yo. zey hobn moyre gehat far undz.

204
00:15:50,800 --> 00:15:52,127
far vos?

205
00:15:52,082 --> 00:15:56,143
vayl s'geven a por shtarke yidn, untervelt yidn.

206
00:15:57,094 --> 00:16:05,255
vos az zey hobn epes getun, gemakht a rokh in mark oder vu dort in velkhn dos,

207
00:16:05,278 --> 00:16:12,444
hobn zey batsolt tayer. eyner oder tsvey mentshn zenen avek, m'hot zey avekgef-

208
00:16:13,007 --> 00:16:23,953
zenen geli- gefunen gevorn in a in a hoyz, geharget toyt. un m'hot nisht gekont keynem bashuldikn, vayl m'hot keynem nisht gevust ver dos hot getun.

209
00:16:25,933 --> 00:16:29,622
ir hot gefilt antisemitizm als a kind?

210
00:16:30,793 --> 00:16:33,892
neyn, mir hobn gevoynt tsvishn yidn.

211
00:16:34,776 --> 00:16:42,212
azoy az mir ho'mir nisht keyn shkheynim velkhe zenen geven polyakn un zoln undz epes tun azoy.

212
00:16:43,855 --> 00:16:47,882
ven zaynt ir tsurikgekumen fun Lvov tsu ayter shtot?

213
00:16:48,580 --> 00:16:49,687
fun vu?

214
00:16:49,373 --> 00:16:52,168
fun Lvo- fun fun Lodzh meyn ikh.

215
00:16:52,613 --> 00:16:54,345
do, fun yetst?

216
00:16:54,840 --> 00:16:57,989
ir zaynt geven a beker in Lodzh?

217
00:16:57,743 --> 00:17:04,959
yo, ale tsvey, ale halbe yor, ale yor, hob ikh bin ikh geven in der heym akht tog, tsen tog.

218
00:17:05,573 --> 00:17:12,266
di yor ikh hob nisht ibergerisn di di tetikeyt,

219
00:17:12,541 --> 00:17:20,602
di di CONNECTION mit di mit di Zdinskevole, mit mayne fraynt, mit di ale zakhn hob ikh nisht ibergerisn.

220
00:17:21,132 --> 00:17:22,864
ikh bin aheymgekumen aheym.

221
00:17:24,169 --> 00:17:25,918
ir hot khasene gehat?

222
00:17:26,852 --> 00:17:34,862
ikh hob khasene gehat mit a Voler iz gevezn dray yor far der milkhome.

223
00:17:35,104 --> 00:17:36,954
vos iz geven ir nomen?

224
00:17:37,213 --> 00:17:38,236
Rakhl.

225
00:17:38,597 --> 00:17:40,008
Rokhl vos?

226
00:17:43,255 --> 00:17:48,024
ikh veys, ikh gedenk nisht. Rakhl, ikh veys Rakhl.

227
00:17:48,463 --> 00:17:50,008
vos far a froy,

228
00:17:48,925 --> 00:17:53,474
Morgnshtern. Morgnshtern. ikh veys, efsher Morgnshtern.

229
00:17:54,493 --> 00:17:56,866
vos far a froy iz zi geven?

230
00:17:56,974 --> 00:18:02,503
a gute froy, a CHAVERA. a a ko- a fraynt.

231
00:18:03,302 --> 00:18:05,928
iz zi geven a religyeze froy?

232
00:18:05,952 --> 00:18:15,936
NO. un di familye iz oykh nisht geven, a zenen yo geven religyez, ober

233
00:18:17,899 --> 00:18:21,352
ikh bin nisht geven dortn keyn psul in di mishpokhe.

234
00:18:23,586 --> 00:18:26,584
a- a- az ir hot khasene gehat,

235
00:18:27,417 --> 00:18:33,536
hot ir genumen ayer froy mit aykh ven ir zaynt gegangen in di andere shteter bakn?

236
00:18:33,120 --> 00:18:39,189
NO. khasene gehat hob ikh mikh gedungen in same front Laske tsvelef.

237
00:18:39,229 --> 00:18:41,973
dos iz geven di same front fun di shtot.

238
00:18:42,385 --> 00:18:45,501
ikh hob nisht aroysgenumen eyn groshn gelt,

239
00:18:45,658 --> 00:18:55,237
s'geven a raykher fun fun, ikh hob gehaltn nis un vayn, tsvey shtubn iz gevezn.

240
00:18:55,885 --> 00:19:04,485
un ikh hob alts ibergelozt. ikh hob nisht gevolt tsurikgeyn, ikh hob gezogt ikh vel nisht tsurikgeyn mer oyf dem farsholtn ort un ikh bin nisht tsurikgeganen.

241
00:19:06,094 --> 00:19:16,027
ober dayn lebn mit ayer vayb, far der milkhome, iz geven in Zdonskavola?

242
00:19:16,236 --> 00:19:17,090
yo.

243
00:19:17,451 --> 00:19:19,993
un ir hot far emetsn gearbet?

244
00:19:19,813 --> 00:19:22,017
neyn, ikh hob gehat a gesheft.

245
00:19:22,429 --> 00:19:23,688
fun vos?

246
00:19:23,610 --> 00:19:25,747
fun a a konditeray.

247
00:19:28,251 --> 00:19:35,062
ven ir hot balangt tsu di organizatsyes, vos far a zakhn hot ir geton?

248
00:19:36,317 --> 00:19:40,766
ikh bin geven der forzitser fun di partey, fun di yugnt.

249
00:19:42,527 --> 00:19:49,474
a shod ikh hob z- ikh hob aykh nisht gevizn dortn, ikh hob nokh a bild fun di fun di grupe f-

250
00:19:51,960 --> 00:19:54,502
un ir hot gemakht sport?

251
00:19:55,167 --> 00:19:58,859
ikh bin geven a redner un ikh hob merstn teyl

252
00:19:58,859 --> 00:20:02,276
hob ikh, ikh bin geven forzitser der,

253
00:20:02,276 --> 00:20:06,394
oder ikh hob ikh hob zikh UNK, ikh bin aroysgetretn, vos

254
00:20:06,394 --> 00:20:09,640
di partey hot gemakht bin ikh dermit aroysgetretn.

255
00:20:10,337 --> 00:20:13,453
un vos andere zakhn hobn zey geton?

256
00:20:13,881 --> 00:20:15,765
m'hot geshpilt teater.

257
00:20:15,940 --> 00:20:17,166
un ir?

258
00:20:17,323 --> 00:20:19,932
ikh oykhet. ikh hob zikh bateylikt in dem.

259
00:20:20,631 --> 00:20:23,510
ir gedenkt vos ir hot epes geshpilt?

260
00:20:23,787 --> 00:20:32,083
ikh ikh ken nisht genoy, nor ikh gedenk di nemen mit dem alemen gedenk ikh nisht.

261
00:20:32,410 --> 00:20:39,593
azoy BUT ikh bin gevezn aktiv. azoy lang vi ikh bin gevezn in di shtot bin ikh gevezn aktiv.

262
00:20:39,885 --> 00:20:48,249
ikh bin nisht geven, ikh bin aroysgeforn, ikh bin merstn teyl, tsulib di ikh gut oyslernen

263
00:20:49,268 --> 00:20:54,206
un zikh bakenen mit di arbetn vos m'arbet in di andere shtet,

264
00:20:54,246 --> 00:21:00,484
bin ikh geforn spetsyel oyf a por khadoshim in di un dort, in dort un do.

265
00:21:00,557 --> 00:21:05,968
azoy az ikh zol zikh ikh zol zikh oysarbetn far mit a gutn nomen.

266
00:21:07,645 --> 00:21:15,806
ven hot ir bamerkt az epes andersh iz in shtot un a milkhome hot zikh oysgebrokhn?

267
00:21:17,314 --> 00:21:27,765
ikh hob ba- bamerkt genug in tsayt un dos BLAME ikh mir az oyf ikh hob tsvey yor frier

268
00:21:27,765 --> 00:21:32,642
eyder di milkhome hot oysgebrokhn, ikh hob nisht gegleybt az m'vet kinder mit

269
00:21:32,642 --> 00:21:40,191
mit froyen vet men toyt makhn, vet men hargenen azoy vi m'harget, ir vet mir antshuldikn, mayz.

270
00:21:40,855 --> 00:21:45,962
fun vanen hot ir dervust dos far tsvey yorn f- far dem?

271
00:21:45,107 --> 00:21:50,040
m'hot zikh dos ershte, az der daytsh iz arayngekumen hobn zey

272
00:21:50,040 --> 00:21:52,830
in dritn tog, er iz arayngekumen mitvokh,

273
00:21:53,308 --> 00:22:01,638
iz shabes in in der fri hot men aroyfgenumen dem, er iz demolt nokh nisht gevezn mayn shver,

274
00:22:01,965 --> 00:22:09,994
BUT dos iz geven un un m'hot zey aroyf- dos hot men im geharget mitn

275
00:22:09,994 --> 00:22:13,282
mit ir's a shvoger, mayn shpeterdik vayb.

276
00:22:13,322 --> 00:22:17,858
Broynyesvam dos di a shvoger, un nokh a yid.

277
00:22:17,858 --> 00:22:24,267
m'hot zey geharget fun a fun a fun eynem vos hot geharget bay di yidishe kehile,

278
00:22:24,308 --> 00:22:30,599
vos hot akhtung gegebn oyf di mikve, hot UNK gege- akhtung gegebn oyf di shul,

279
00:22:30,599 --> 00:22:37,261
akhtung gegebn oyf besmedresh, oyfge- akhtung gegebn oyf di oyf di ale zakhn.

280
00:22:37,858 --> 00:22:44,281
er hot arayngebrengt dem ershtn m'zol hargenen, di di zelner zenen gekumen dray zelner

281
00:22:44,322 --> 00:22:46,189
un zey hobn geharget di yidn.

282
00:22:46,718 --> 00:22:48,247
ir hot dos gezen?

283
00:22:48,844 --> 00:22:55,405
ikh bin nisht ikh bin gehat geven, ikh hob a a sakh tsu dertseyln vegn mayn tsveytn

284
00:22:55,405 --> 00:22:57,157
zun vos ikh hob gehat,

285
00:22:57,585 --> 00:23:04,970
punkt iz aroysgekumen a tog far far di milkh- far dem oysbrukh fun di tsveyte milkhome.

286
00:23:06,208 --> 00:23:10,960
azoy az ikh hob zikh nokh gebroykht tsu farhaltn a por tog in veg.

287
00:23:11,659 --> 00:23:19,787
s'nokh geven tsu tsu a nes un tsu geferlekh tsu kumen tsurik in di shtot arayn.

288
00:23:19,995 --> 00:23:21,339
vos iz geven?

289
00:23:21,919 --> 00:23:32,122
vayl m'hot gezen zenen di di di kristn, vayl ale zenen gevorn folks-doytshn.

290
00:23:32,719 --> 00:23:38,568
ale hobn zikh ge- ongetun azelkhene hitlekh un zenen gevorn daytshn, folks-daytshn.

291
00:23:42,152 --> 00:23:47,563
un keyner iz nisht geven azoy shtark vi vi er, vi zey.

292
00:23:50,168 --> 00:23:54,735
ir hot bamerkt imigrantn in ayer shtot?

293
00:23:54,825 --> 00:23:56,608
in a por tog shpeter.

294
00:23:57,154 --> 00:23:58,272
vos iz geven?

295
00:23:57,357 --> 00:24:03,951
fun di shtetlekh un arum un arum zenen gekumen, zenen zey hobn ibergelot a bisl toyte,

296
00:24:03,951 --> 00:24:11,840
un a bisl dos dos in di un un zey hobn gelebt, zey hobn zikh tsuzamen geshtupt mit di mishpokhes

297
00:24:11,840 --> 00:24:14,225
un m'hot azoy gelebt a por vokhn.

298
00:24:15,818 --> 00:24:22,224
ven zaynen di daytshn arayn tsu ayer shtot? di natsis.

299
00:24:22,652 --> 00:24:26,901
ven zey ven di daytshn zenen in gantsn arayn, di

300
00:24:26,901 --> 00:24:29,986
tsvey tog nokh dem vi di milkhome hot zikh ongehoybn.

301
00:24:30,297 --> 00:24:34,695
un vos vos hot getrofn? vos hot men geton?

302
00:24:36,827 --> 00:24:44,111
ikh ken nisht dos dershraybn EX- EXACTLY vos m'hot vos s- s'hot pasirt,

303
00:24:44,404 --> 00:24:49,613
BUT zenen arumgelofn vi di vilde khayes.

304
00:24:50,226 --> 00:24:51,502
di daytshn?

305
00:24:50,412 --> 00:24:51,975
farsamte, yo.

306
00:24:53,331 --> 00:24:54,725
m'hot geshlogn?

307
00:24:54,883 --> 00:24:59,804
geshlogn un un toyt gemakht un vos m'hot getun.

308
00:25:00,216 --> 00:25:07,483
s'gornisht do keyn raykhe s'nishto keyn eyntslne verter vos m'kon dertseyln.

309
00:25:08,113 --> 00:25:09,845
vos hot ir geton?

310
00:25:10,965 --> 00:25:17,366
ikh zog dokh aykh, az ikh bin nokh geven in Lodzh biz di nentster shabes, biz

311
00:25:17,366 --> 00:25:21,675
shabes bay to- di bay nakht, heyst fraytik bay nakht.

312
00:25:21,681 --> 00:25:28,863
hob ikh genumen a droshke, un ge- tsurikgeforn mit di tsvey kinderlekh, tsurikgeforn,

313
00:25:28,937 --> 00:25:38,027
vayl dos kind iz geboyrn gevorn nokh, oyb ikh meg meg ikh dertseyln vi azoy dos kind iz geboyrn gevorn? vi?

314
00:25:37,830 --> 00:25:38,634
yo.

315
00:25:38,505 --> 00:25:44,501
dos kind iz geboyrn gevorn in a in a zelner,

316
00:25:44,501 --> 00:25:52,505
dos heyst a VO- a UNK, in in in UNK in di shto- in a shtikl unter di shtot.

317
00:25:52,967 --> 00:25:54,901
un s'geven dort a dokter.

318
00:25:55,161 --> 00:26:01,179
un zi hot un mayn froy Rokhl hot gefilt az zi darf geyn tsum kind.

319
00:26:01,641 --> 00:26:06,140
iz hob ikh gezogt dem dokter, a klal, hob ikh zikh genumen dertsu.

320
00:26:06,231 --> 00:26:09,735
un zi hot gehat dos kind, a groys kind.

321
00:26:11,023 --> 00:26:16,724
ven zi hot gehat dos kind iz s'hot nisht lang gelebt.

322
00:26:16,724 --> 00:26:21,142
hot gelebt efsher dray khadoshim, s'iz zikh gegangen zayn veg.

323
00:26:23,612 --> 00:26:27,943
un vos hot ir gezen ven ir zaynt tsurikgekumen in ayer shtetl?

324
00:26:29,451 --> 00:26:37,851
ikh hob gezen az es geyen keseyder zenen gegangen mushtirt in reyes in in opteylunger,

325
00:26:37,851 --> 00:26:40,886
un gezungen fun in di shtot.

326
00:26:41,500 --> 00:26:47,909
a nakht zenen zey geven a a polyak un un er iz geven a khaver un er iz geven a fraynt,

327
00:26:47,909 --> 00:26:51,816
un mit eyn mol iz er gevorn a a a folks-doytsh,

328
00:26:51,816 --> 00:26:56,833
un un un shoyn un un shoyn, du bist a JUDE, o!

329
00:26:58,881 --> 00:27:01,642
dernokh dem hot er genumen a- ale yidn.

330
00:27:01,986 --> 00:27:07,548
eltere yidn, nor undz ho'mir gehat a froy, zi hot geheysn Shpranger.

331
00:27:08,078 --> 00:27:11,345
di Shpranger hot opgehitn ire yidn.

332
00:27:12,803 --> 00:27:19,735
un m'hot mikh a mol gezolt, demolts hobn a mol geredt oyf mir polyakn un un gevolt mikh avekshikn,

333
00:27:19,735 --> 00:27:25,338
vayl ikh hob epes gezogt epes eynem az er iz a er iz a merder, er iz a dos o.

334
00:27:25,338 --> 00:27:32,253
hot zi zikh ayngeshtelt, dos nisht. Pyetrokovska hot nokh keynem hot nisht keynem baleydikt.

335
00:27:32,648 --> 00:27:34,819
zi iz geven a poylishe froy?

336
00:27:34,318 --> 00:27:35,847
zi iz geven a daytshe.

337
00:27:35,938 --> 00:27:42,193
zi iz geven a groyse a groyse makher, ober dos iz nor ⟨di vorheyt⟩.

338
00:27:43,026 --> 00:27:46,581
ir hot gekent forn tsurik tsu ayer hoyz?

339
00:27:46,350 --> 00:27:50,844
yo, in di shtot arayn hob ikh azoy vi lang gekont forn hob ikh gekont forn.

340
00:27:50,844 --> 00:27:53,601
ikh hob gemegt gekont forn nokh Tshenstekohv.

341
00:27:53,927 --> 00:27:57,212
ikh hob gekont forn farshidns.

342
00:27:57,640 --> 00:28:01,161
ikh bin nisht mer geforn vi Tshenstekohv un Lodzh,

343
00:28:01,217 --> 00:28:06,898
un un dernokh bin ikh geforn nokh Varshe, shpeter ersht.

344
00:28:07,647 --> 00:28:10,712
ven iz ven zaynt ir geforn keyn Varshe?

345
00:28:11,072 --> 00:28:16,213
keyn Varshe bin ikh geforn dos iz geven a a mol dray fertl yor shpeter.

346
00:28:17,552 --> 00:28:19,081
durkh der milkhome?

347
00:28:19,088 --> 00:28:20,617
neyn, in di milkhome.

348
00:28:23,188 --> 00:28:26,776
vi azoy zaynt ir ge- geforn keyn Varshe?

349
00:28:26,142 --> 00:28:29,916
bay undz iz nokh geven tsvey tsvey banen.

350
00:28:30,580 --> 00:28:35,737
Harbe Gedil- Gedinya un un di geveyntlekhe ban.

351
00:28:36,064 --> 00:28:39,635
di daytshn hobn aykh aroysgelozt fun shtot?

352
00:28:38,713 --> 00:28:44,057
yo, di da- s'nisht geven keyn shum, m'hot gekont tsu forn a bisl.

353
00:28:44,545 --> 00:28:45,590
iz vos,

354
00:28:44,772 --> 00:28:49,794
finef zeks UNK, ikh veys nisht, genoy gedenk ikh nisht. nor ikh bin geforn.

355
00:28:51,606 --> 00:28:52,325
mit a-

356
00:28:51,825 --> 00:28:53,557
ikh bin geven in Kroke.

357
00:28:55,285 --> 00:28:57,591
mir ayere kinder un ayer,

358
00:28:56,803 --> 00:28:58,231
NO, aleyn.

359
00:28:59,689 --> 00:29:11,343
mayn froy iz gevezn zeyer a a farshtendlekhe froy un nisht geven keyn BA- CRY-BABY. nor a mentsh.

360
00:29:17,273 --> 00:29:26,433
kent ir mir zogn vi hobn zikh bahaltn di daytshn tsu aykh eyder ir zaynt arayn in geto?

361
00:29:28,765 --> 00:29:34,192
ikh hob gehat a gesheft, ikh hob gehat a khaver, hot er geheysn Zelig Livrant.

362
00:29:35,093 --> 00:29:37,837
der Zelig Livrant hot far mir gebakn.

363
00:29:37,928 --> 00:29:42,326
er hot gehat a bekeray dortn, un SAME er hot gevoynt in same front.

364
00:29:43,159 --> 00:29:48,165
nisht vayt, er hot gevoynt nisht vayt. er hot far mir oysgebakn ale tog

365
00:29:48,171 --> 00:29:52,822
a zekl veytsn-mel, un m'hot gemakht derfun beygl.

366
00:29:53,149 --> 00:30:01,043
ikh hob dos farkoyft in mayn gesheft. zeks vokhn. genug.

